<title>GERMANY: Altana eyes FDA approval on new drug.</title>
<headline>Altana eyes FDA approval on new drug.</headline>
<dateline>BAD HOMBURG, Germany 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and pharmaceuticals group Altana AG said on Wednesday it would launch a new drug in the U.S. at some point in the future but already expected to receive official approval for the product.</p>
<p>The family-owned group said its Byk Gulden subsidiary expected to receive approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Adminstration to launch a respiratory drug but that the drug would only be launched after successful clinical tests in several years time.</p>
</text>
